{"other_titles": ["Feminist manifesto in fifteen suggestions"], "description": "Receiving a letter from a friend asking her how to raise her baby girl to be a feminist, Adichie responded with fifteen suggestions for how to empower a daughter to become a strong, independent woman. Her suggestions ranged from options for non-stereotyped toy options, to debunking myths that women are somehow biologically programmed to be in the kitchen instead of having a career. Adichie's letter will start an urgently needed conversation about what it really means to be a woman today.", "local_id": ["urn:phillips:31867003084634", "urn:sfpl:31223118397224", "urn:sfpl:31223118396390", "urn:sfpl:31223118396382", "urn:sfpl:31223118396440", "urn:sfpl:31223118396457", "urn:sfpl:31223118396358", "urn:sfpl:31223122359111", "urn:sfpl:31223122359129", "urn:sfpl:31223122359137", "urn:sfpl:31223118857227", "urn:sfpl:31223118857219", "urn:sfpl:31223118857201", "urn:sfpl:31223118396333", "urn:sfpl:31223118396341", "urn:sfpl:31223118396325", "urn:sfpl:31223118396465", "urn:sfpl:31223118396473", "urn:sfpl:31223118397208", "urn:sfpl:31223118397216", "urn:sfpl:31223118396366", "urn:sfpl:31223118396374", "urn:bwbsku:O7-BSB-565"], "key": "/books/OL26881793M", "authors": [{"key": "/authors/OL1393502A"}], "languages": [{"key": "/languages/eng"}], "pagination": "63 pages", "source_records": ["marc:marc_openlibraries_phillipsacademy/PANO_FOR_IA_05072019.mrc:566569:2066", "marc:marc_openlibraries_sanfranciscopubliclibrary/sfpl_chq_2018_12_24_run05.mrc:426840734:6862", "bwb:9781524733131", "promise:bwb_daily_pallets_2021-07-13", "marc:marc_columbia/Columbia-extract-20221130-030.mrc:161461518:2937", "marc:marc_columbia/Columbia-extract-20221130-025.mrc:216028692:2259", "amazon:152473313X", "marc:marc_nuls/NULS_PHC_180925.mrc:156631636:2271", "marc:harvard_bibliographic_metadata/20220215_003.bib.mrc:8366150:7397"], "title": "Dear Ijeawele, or A feminist manifesto in fifteen suggestions", "notes": "\"This is a sl